From: Package maintainers <packages@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] layer system configuration paths
Source: downstream
Upstream: not submitted; suitable for upstream review

Select a complete main file from the administrator, transient, and vendor
paths. Merge relative configuration directories by basename across the same
paths, with empty higher-priority files masking lower files. Track every
search directory so Fontconfig can notice files and directories that appear
after it loads the configuration.

